       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CALLER.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 N PIC 9(3) VALUE 7.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           CALL "SQUARE" USING BY CONTENT N
           DISPLAY "N STILL " N
           STOP RUN.
       END PROGRAM CALLER.
       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. SQUARE.
       DATA DIVISION.
       LINKAGE SECTION.
       01 X PIC 9(3).
       PROCEDURE DIVISION USING X.
           COMPUTE X = X * X
           DISPLAY "SQUARED " X
           GOBACK.
       END PROGRAM SQUARE.
